# To-Do List App 📝

A simple and beginner-friendly To-Do List application built to practise and strengthen my web development skills.

## About the Project

This project allows users to add tasks and display them on a webpage. It was developed as part of my journey towards becoming a professional web developer.

## Technologies Used

- HTML5 – Structure
- CSS3 – Styling and layout
- JavaScript – Functionality and DOM manipulation

## Features

- Add new tasks.
- Display tasks dynamically on the webpage.
- Simple and user-friendly interface.

## What I Learned

While building this project, I practised:

- DOM manipulation.
- JavaScript event listeners.
- Handling user input.
- Working with HTML elements using JavaScript.
- Connecting HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

## Future Improvements

- Delete tasks.
- Mark tasks as completed.
- Save tasks using Local Storage.
- Improve mobile responsiveness.

